  "top_assumptions": [
    "Retail and Digital Services segments continue as primary growth engines: Retail revenue grew ~28% YoY (FY22: \u20b91,99,749 cr vs FY21: \u20b91,57,702 cr) and Digital Services maintained ~\u20b91,00,161 cr with massive capex of \u20b982,744 cr in FY22 signalling accelerated 5G/Jio infrastructure buildout; combined, these two segments are assumed to sustain 18-22% annual growth through FY25 driven by subscriber additions, ARPU expansion, and new commerce initiatives.",
