  ],
  "reasoning": "FY22 consolidated revenue was \u20b97,92,756 crore (net of GST: \u20b97,21,634 cr), up ~47% YoY, driven largely by O2C commodity price recovery and strong Retail growth. Net profit attributable to owners was \u20b960,705 crore with basic EPS of \u20b992.00 (after exceptional items). Total capex of \u20b91,45,352 crore \u2014 heavily weighted toward Digital Services (\u20b982,744 cr) and Retail (\u20b929,873 cr) \u2014 signals management conviction in consumer-facing segments as future growth pillars. Gross debt stood at \u20b92,66,305 crore against equity of \u20b97,79,485 crore (net gearing ~0.04x), providing balance sheet headroom for continued investment. Forecasts apply a blended ~16% revenue CAGR for FY23-25, tapering from ~20% in FY23 as O2C price tailwinds moderate, with net income margins expanding modestly as high-margin digital and retail mix increases and finance costs (\u20b914,584 cr in FY22) gradually decline on debt repayment."
